{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39281","headline":"送李秀才归荆溪 · 韦庄","name":"送李秀才归荆溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月中秋月正圆，送君吟上木兰船。\n人言格调胜玄度，我爱篇章敌浪僊。\n晚渡去时冲细雨，夜滩何处宿寒烟。\n楚王宫去阳台近，莫倚风流滞少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}